                    sw_classify REUSED AS CODE. A = (1 - 2w) x 0.1293 at §56's
                    w = 0.025150 for these eighths.
  session           60.0 s of simulated life x 320 sessions, 4 arms x 80 reps
  instrument        slotexp   trial seed 0000000001357e79   320 sessions
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)

  creatures live  0/320

  *** AIBABY_SLOTEXP_FORCE_GATES is set and the budget is SHORT. G0 is
  being read against §53's and §58's 900k figures on a 60000-tick run, so it
  SHOULD differ. A branch exercise, NOT a measurement. ***

  THE VERDICT FUNCTION'S SIX BRANCHES, exercised on synthetic input at this
  run's own A = +0.12280 before any real row reaches it. It is §58's
  `sw_classify` called as code, so this also checks that reuse compiled to
  the same thing (`deferral-note-is-untested-code`: real rows cannot test a
  branch they never take, and UNDEFINED has a registered 8.2% chance here).
    S -0.1064  E 0.0266  -> ARTEFACT DOMINATES                ok  (well below -2E)
    S +0.0000  E 0.0266  -> §53's NULL SURVIVES              ok  (zero)
    S +0.0665  E 0.0266  -> PARTIAL                           ok  (above 2E, below A - 2E)
    S +0.1228  E 0.0266  -> EXPRESSES AS AVERAGING PREDICTS   ok  (exactly averaging's prediction)
    S +0.2026  E 0.0266  -> OVER-EXPRESSES                    ok  (above A + 2E)
    S +0.0317  E 0.0317  -> UNDEFINED -- the models are closer than 4 SE ok  (A < 4E: the models are too close)
    branches reachable  6/6  PASS

  G0 -- TRANSFER, READ FIRST. The ARCHIVE subset of each arm (r < its own
  published count) must reproduce §53's whole-session table and §58's phase
  windows to four decimals INCLUDING the SE. Thirteen windows over all four
  arms. The scorer is §59a's and the reps are §53's, so what is being tested
  is that a DIFFERENT ENCLOSING EXPERIMENT over a DIFFERENT rep range still
  produces the archived session -- if it does not, the fresh numbers below
  are a different experiment and nothing here is readable. A 900k
  comparison: UNDEFINED below that budget, never failed there.
